        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AYBABTU ( All Your Base Are Belong To us ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens are attacking the White House! Go get 'em!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun and challenging RETRO &quot;Shoot 'Em Up&quot; style game  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a cataclysmic dawn over Washington D.C., a vast armada of alien spaceships descended upon the White House, unleashing chaos from the skies. Sleek, needle-like scouts darted like hornets, firing precision plasma bolts that melted Secret Service barricades, while colossal saucer dreadnoughts hovered ominously, bombarding the grounds with seismic graviton waves that cracked the earth. Flanking them were biomechanical horrors—writhing tendril ships spewing corrosive mists, and stealthy prism vessels that refracted laser grids into deadly rainbows. As the presidential residence endured the onslaught, humanity's fate hung by a thread against this symphony of interstellar fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't have time for a long drawn out battle? We've got You covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to destroy as much as possible, as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, if You Speed Run to reach the finish of a quick game, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your jet will hover around in the End Zone, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and You can take a screenshot of Your High Score to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different alien ship types  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different alien weapons  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Power-ups to gain missiles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Laser Cannons  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Score Counter  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High intensity music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool RETRO Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTROLS: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys to Move  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers are auto-fire  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[A] to fire missiles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also Point &amp; Click Mouse to move  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OR  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and Drag Mouse to move  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use a Gamepad / XBOX Controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DPAD to Move  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers are auto-fire  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[A] to fire missiles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the highest score You can get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did You notice any &quot;Easter Eggs&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
